    "message": "Share a generated Scenario built through the UI preview\n\nTests mostly used fixture Scenarios without a floor plan or facility\nawareness, so faults that need both (#51) slipped past them. conftest now\nbuilds one small Scenario from the demo-v2 form input through the same\nProjectAPI preview as the UI, with only regional research stubbed. Its run\nis pinned as generated_small in the regression contract, and two existing\ntests use it as examples.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
